                            RESP(WS-RESP)
                  END-EXEC
               END-PERFORM.
               EXEC CICS ENDBR FILE('KSDSCL98') END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       CHECK-TAX-BAND-0118.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
               STRING WS-KEY-CUSTOMER DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         '/'              DELIMITED BY SIZE
